          "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tBGL_0015 Log Summary Dataset / BGL 日志总结数据集\n\t\n\nThis dataset is designed for fine-tuning Large Language Models (LLMs) to generate high-quality failure summaries from BGL (BlueGene/L) system logs. The log windows are derived/sliced from the LogHub/BGL dataset.\n本项目用于为 BGL (BlueGene/L) 系统日志微调大语言模型 (LLM)，使其具备根据原始日志窗口生成高质量故障摘要 (Log Summary) 的能力。其中的日志窗口数据源自 LogHub/BGL 数据集切分而来。\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\t1. Dataset Usage / 数据集用途\n\t\n\nGoal: Enable LLMs to generate high-quality, BGL-specific summaries under… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/dtldr/BGL_0015-log-summary.",
